flowchart TB
Upload[Authorized bounded upload] --> Validate[Type size and parse validation]
Validate --> Parse[Text parsing]
Parse --> Chunk[Document chunking]
Chunk --> Embed[Versioned lexical or approved semantic embeddings]
Embed --> Vector[pgvector matching dimensions]
Query[Owned document query] --> Retrieve[Authorization constrained retrieval]
Vector --> Retrieve
Retrieve --> Sources[Supporting sources and citations]
Delete[Owned update or delete] --> Index[Index consistency and retrieval removal]
Index --> Vector
